Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:52.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}スキと言えば簡単なのに
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:55.83,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}キミが前に来ちゃうと
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:08:02.04,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}個性がそびえ　私のコトを邪魔してる
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:06.79,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}いつもならば強気でイケる
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:10.05,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}そんな性格なのに
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:16.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どんな頑張ってみても壁は崩せない
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:20.06,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}察して欲しい…この気持ちを
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.81,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}だから私は　いつもキミに
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:27.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}大好きだよと　送る視線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:31.03,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}最大の勇気で！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}破れそうな　シルクノハート
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:38.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}キミに逢って気づいた　やっと
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:43.83,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}愛には不器用だったんだって
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}忘れかけた　恋の傷跡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:52.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}急に疼きだしたの　キュンと
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:56.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}いつかは私らしくスキと
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:09:01.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}言わなきゃ…今より弱くなっちゃうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:37.72,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}24{\3c&H439AF4&}小{\3c&HE5D885&}時{\3c&H4FBBD3&}一{\3c&H5E47F0&}直{\3c&HB250EF&}都{\3c&H439AF4&}會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.35,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}每{\3c&H439AF4&}當{\3c&HE5D885&}想{\3c&H4FBBD3&}起{\3c&H5E47F0&}你{\3c&HB250EF&}的{\3c&H439AF4&}時{\3c&HE5D885&}候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.94,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}這{\3c&H439AF4&}份{\3c&HE5D885&}急{\3c&H4FBBD3&}不{\3c&H5E47F0&}可{\3c&HB250EF&}待{\3c&H439AF4&}的{\3c&HE5D885&}心{\3c&H4FBBD3&}情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:48.48,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}只{\3c&H439AF4&}會{\3c&HE5D885&}不{\3c&H4FBBD3&}斷{\3c&H5E47F0&}在{\3c&HB250EF&}心{\3c&H439AF4&}房{\3c&HE5D885&}滿{\3c&H4FBBD3&}溢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:52.61,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}一句喜歡你明明如此簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:55.83,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}可是站在你面前時
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:08:02.04,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}個性就不請自來地妨礙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:06.79,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}如果是平時的話  我就能強勢硬撐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:10.05,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}明明我就是這種性格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:16.43,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}可是無論怎麼努力都無法突破這堵高牆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:20.06,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}請你快點察覺到…我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.81,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}所以  我一直都對你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:27.36,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}傳遞著  最喜歡你的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:31.03,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}竭盡我最大的勇氣!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.70,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}這顆絲絨般的心臟  彷彿快要被撕裂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:38.20,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}在遇到你之際  讓我終於明白到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:43.83,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}愛情原來就是如此笨拙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.92,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&HB250EF&}這道戀愛的傷痕  已經快要忘卻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:52.47,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}卻突然間  再次撕心裂肺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:56.01,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}總有一天我要找回自己的原色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:09:01.85,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}並大聲說出喜歡你…不然會比現在更加懦弱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}似てても違うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:20.31,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}マンダリン　オレンジ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}友達　恋人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}２人のココロも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}傷つきたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:33.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}私は逃げてた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:37.30,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}そしたら光も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:41.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}射してはくれない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:44.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}奇跡なのにね
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}出逢いも恋も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}種もつぼみも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:58.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}まだ青い　実でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:01.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}オレンジ色は　あの日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}見た夕焼けを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}思い出させてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:08.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}２つの影が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:13.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}手を繋いでるみたいだった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:15.72,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}オレンジ　いつか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:17.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}甘くなるかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:20.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}それともしぼんじゃうの？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.59,0:22:23.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}私の未来知りたくなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:26.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}ぜんぶ食べた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:29.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}すっぱい…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:38.26,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好きだけど泣けるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:44.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}オレンジ色に　早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:46.35,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}なりたい果実
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:49.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}キミの光を浴びて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.75,0:22:53.15,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}理想や夢は膨らむばかり
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:56.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}気づいてよ　ねぇ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:58.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}オレンジ　今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:00.03,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}食べてみたけど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}まだすっぱくて　泣いた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:06.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}私みたいで残せないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:09.33,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}ぜんぶ食べた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:15.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好きだよ　すっぱい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:22.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}泣けるよ　好きだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好きだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.80,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}雖然相似卻不相同
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:20.31,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}橘子  橙子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.66,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}朋友  戀人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.56,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}兩人的心意也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.53,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}因為不想受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:33.95,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}所以我逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:37.30,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}於是就連陽光也
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:41.35,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}無法照射進來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:44.24,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}明明就是奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.68,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}無論邂逅  還是戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.94,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}無論種子  還是花蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:58.74,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}就連那青澀的果實也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:01.90,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}那一天的橙色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.48,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}只是夕陽斜照
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.77,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}讓我回憶起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:08.81,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}我們兩人的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:13.71,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}就好像牽著手一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:15.72,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}橙子要到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:17.25,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}才能變甜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:20.52,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}還是說  會變皺縮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.59,0:22:23.98,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}因為我不想知道自己的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:26.53,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}就全部吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:29.80,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好酸…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:38.26,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}雖然很喜歡  卻黯然落淚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.74,0:22:44.74,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好像早日變成
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:46.35,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}橙色的果實
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:49.64,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}在你的溫柔沐浴之下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.75,0:22:53.15,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}理想和夢想不斷在壯大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:56.43,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}你啊  快點察覺到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:58.60,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}我今天也想著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:00.03,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}吃吃橙子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.37,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}不過還是很酸澀  讓我留下了眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:06.92,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}因為它跟我一樣  不忍心吃剩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:09.33,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}就全部吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:15.65,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}好喜歡你  好心酸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:22.44,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}淚水不言而流  我喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.45,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3\an9\fs-1}我喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:34.89,Title,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H5C5C5C&\pos(915,524)}龍與虎!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.87,0:00:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,高須
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要追上去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,高須走左邊  我走右邊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,學生會會長  有人在走廊奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這次就網開一面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.97,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,追上之後  我要說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,教學樓入口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大河能聽到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  你一直都想知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我對高須…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡高須龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡他  一直都喜歡他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  我覺得必須要讓給你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果身為閨蜜的你需要高須的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這是傲慢的我的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小看了你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才我有說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我的幸福要由自己決定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,同理你的幸福  只有你才能決定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以大河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我看看你的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我摔了一跤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,止血了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.23,0:01:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,還以為你哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你認為我會哭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一般來說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,當然會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那就有回報了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,還記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我說過「能看到的存在」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,記得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我內心的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,意氣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,意氣?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說過  我弟弟在打棒球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也有打棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,說實話  我的才能還在他之上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  我沒能繼續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,以自己是女生為藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我在存錢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,靠自己考上體育大學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,立志成為日本第一的壘球選手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然後就對全世界吶喊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我選擇的  緊握在手的幸福就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這只是我的意氣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因為  我執意要實現這個目標
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以決定不會再哭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,即使再艱辛痛苦  也決定要咬緊牙關努力奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人把自己的艱辛  痛苦和哭泣看在眼裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也算是有回報了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那個髮夾怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那個肯定是你在平安夜想送給我的禮物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起  一開始我是不知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,還以為是大河給我的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,明明決定了不會接受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,卻又傷害了你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在你面前戴那個髮夾  我為此道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,髮夾現在在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在我房間裡  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我不會收下的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我還有另外一個「能看到的存在」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,高須喜歡大河
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:03:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant  告別
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,朝著能看到的存在全力奔跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,高須
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,果然來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在奇怪的地方你挺安份守己的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得即使你會逃跑  但一定會來打工
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那個關於剛才的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那個我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到了實乃梨的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你  不要笑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,打工結束後再聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我又想逃跑的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就好好抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到不少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你說謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,泰…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,泰子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你在這種地方到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,別碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,別再固執了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己一個能做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是高須吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,感謝你一直對她的照料
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她今後會和我一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,誰要和你這種人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,和你的男人  還有他的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不明白的是小泰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,明明約好不能打工的  但是小龍卻撒謊打破了約定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這種事不能原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,居然說不能原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是為了我才增加工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才病倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我也要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,這哪裡有問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,家人相互扶持是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管別家的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我們家只要小龍能努力學習就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:07:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,找到自己想做的事  出色地生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是誰沒有學習
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,捨棄自己想做的事  沒能成為出色的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小龍…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,別把自己的失敗全都推到我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大河?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,別跑  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那個死老頭生意失敗就趁夜潛逃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然後生母就說由她撫養我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她已經有了新的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子裡還有小寶寶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她現在的男人很高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子出生後  腿肯定很長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,變得只有我像是沒進化一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這種…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎麼能融入這種家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在的話  那個家肯定很不自然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在死老頭那裡也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因為有我這種人  大家才…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是一直這樣想的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果沒有我  泰子肯定能過上更幸福的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她還很年輕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,還能繼續讀高中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大人真的很任性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,讓別人遵循自己的想法  將其耍得團團轉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,或許是我把泰子耍得團團轉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我還是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  只要沒有我的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  你這個豬腦筋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,別輕舉妄動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  感覺你有很大的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,禿頭  禿頭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,做出那種事又有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.27,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,居然說「因為有我在」這種撒嬌的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才不也這樣說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有你在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你喜歡上別人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,今後會和別人過日子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就算這樣  我也情願
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想看著你  一直看著高須龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以別再說「沒有自己就好了」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:01.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,還這樣問  你想殺死我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭  真遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是說對不起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有  你沒有說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你還真是斤斤計較
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼血型的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,金牛座
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚星座占卜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,成吉思汗燒很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,兩個月後  我就18歲了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我們就這樣逃離泰子她們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,逃跑  不斷逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,睡覺然後醒來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,再不斷不斷逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,然後等到我生日
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你嫁給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話  我們也是大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不會讓任何人妨礙我們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,直到生命最後一刻  我都把自己的人生託付給你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我對你…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,給我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真狡猾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明明說好是我先說的  讓你好好聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你這條狡猾狗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,說什麼呢  這種事就讓男人來說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我來說  畢竟和實乃梨約好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我要展示自己的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那就一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,對你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  居然在這種關鍵時刻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,無視吧  趕緊繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天氣也很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼這樣說  氣氛都糟蹋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快接
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.78,0:12:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,北村?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:13:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你和逢坂的家長為了找你們  到處在聯絡人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  現在給我來這個地點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  北村
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻涕飛到頭髮上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你們怎麼弄成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要在你家集合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你們母親的搜查網還沒到我這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,今天阿姨他們不在  快進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再這樣下去會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,先去洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,走到盡頭右轉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,還有這些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然會讓你照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,川嶋?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  祐作說會把你的換穿衣服帶過來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺很多事都麻煩你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是喜歡大河吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好好說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡大河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在我面前秀恩愛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是你硬要我說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我這麼擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙  這傢伙  這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨  實乃梨  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,北村  這麼麻煩你  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:40.10,Comment,,0,0,0,,大河  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不過  你們接下來要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要私奔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,還有兩個月嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼就接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,私奔  然後結婚?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.19,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太飛躍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒說只要等到他18歲  然後就…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再說  你們打算住哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這個的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,總之去商務酒店或者漫畫咖啡廳什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,打算這樣生活下去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說  等我們回來之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得能回到原來的生活嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果家長提出尋人啟事  成為全校的話題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.31,0:15:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,弄不好的話  會被退學的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的東西都會被摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以已經決定不會再奢求什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我的心意得到了回報
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,願望成真了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:16:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想打破「想要的東西都會被摧毀」的魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不對  是必須要打破
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這是剛好充滿人情味的存摺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面有我打工存下的所有錢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.55,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,高須
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大河
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不認為你們的選擇是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也絕對不會贊同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果這就是你的做法  我就無法反對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,為了將來能還給我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我家別墅的鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去過一次  應該知道怎麼去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,川嶋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可別把我忘記了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝  大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼亞美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨和亞美稍微有些話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我要和你這種人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你們和好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  笨蛋吉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼實乃梨和笨蛋吉  我們下次見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要再見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什麼話要說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  放手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,腰腿都軟了  站不起來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  你幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  想讓我看你哭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,眼淚是心靈的鼻血
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼淚是為什麼而流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因為大河被高須搶走了?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:18:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,明明決定了不會哭  絕對不會再哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,懦弱的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我明白到一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在走廊摔倒的話  會流鼻血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在人生摔倒的話  會流眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜  我們這個年齡就談論人生還為時尚早
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,今後的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,十年後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,二十年後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,六十年後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,都還在人生的途中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,準備好後  就要巧妙地逃出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我會做好的  等會見
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  帶上吹風機
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想只有自己的行李很重
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼你別帶那麼多輕飄飄的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,會很佔位置
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,準備好後  就馬上逃出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼事的話  就馬上聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  馬上聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒有回來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小鸚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,泰子?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:32.10,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\c&H2E241A&\3c&H85796F&}給小龍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這是外公外婆的地址
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,給他們看到這個手錶  他們應該就能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,魅羅乃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她傍晚打電話來說要休息一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.57,0:19:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,居然逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也太孩子氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一味的逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,即使到了生日
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也無法成為大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你昨天不是炫耀過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快吃掉  你要炫耀到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那個的話  最佳品嘗期結束為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是說學校不是交換巧克力的地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,又沒有交換  我只是帶過來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧  老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,請假了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,高須也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  兩個人都感冒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「發燒」了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight On Fight On Fight On
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight On  大橋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:59.39,Comment,,0,0,0,,Fight On Fight On Fight On
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不去送他們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼  聽不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是強肌心臟女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,同時被高須和大河甩了  也是受不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要和你打雪仗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,接招吧  純白無瑕的白丸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是私奔吃的零食
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以選了些成熟一點的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  雪茄巧克力和香辣豬肉仙貝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,做了便當
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,私奔的便當肯定要吃車站便當的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我會吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨  怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她只會在乎面子而已
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,應該不會弄出騷動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰  怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這個的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是現在  我才會說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰說我們是一家三口時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.52,0:22:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我開心得都想叫出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.97,0:22:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家況不是那樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就想那樣成為真正的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰會哭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這又不是永別
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不是討厭私奔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得非常棒  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  大河…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子她爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,孩…孩子她爸!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.70,0:22:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這個確實是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:22:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.79,0:23:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面  我就是你們的孫子  高須龍兒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.27,0:23:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是我老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,於此  我有事相求
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不是應該逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒給我展示的  只屬於他的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.71,0:23:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這次就輪到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒  你別笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也不要生氣
